<div class="container py-5">
  <h2 class="page-title mb-4">Warranty Policy</h2>

  <div class="card info-card p-4">
    <h5>Vehicle Warranty Coverage</h5>
    <p>
      All LuxCart vehicles come with a limited warranty covering mechanical
      and manufacturing defects, subject to inspection and verification.
    </p>

    <h5 class="mt-4">Accessories Warranty</h5>
    <p>
      Accessories are covered under manufacturer warranties ranging
      from 6 to 12 months.
    </p>

    <h5 class="mt-4">What Is Covered</h5>
    <ul>
      <li>Engine and transmission defects</li>
      <li>Electrical system failures</li>
      <li>Manufacturing faults</li>
    </ul>

    <h5 class="mt-4">What Is Not Covered</h5>
    <ul>
      <li>Normal wear and tear</li>
      <li>Damage due to misuse or accidents</li>
      <li>Unauthorized modifications</li>
    </ul>

    <h5 class="mt-4">Warranty Claims</h5>
    <p>
      Claims must be submitted within the warranty period along with
      supporting documentation and inspection reports.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>